## 4. Thesis bridge

Each Phase-2 prior prototypes a thesis quadrant on classical machinery before the DL
version: the topological prior IS the "AT-only (cubical PH segmentation)" quadrant listed
as TODO in the thesis ROADMAP; the spatial-prior registration machinery is reusable for the
DG quadrants' deformation/LDDMM work. And the comparative's result — whichever way it lands
— is the empirical answer to "why does the thesis need geometric/topological methods,"
grounded in a stratified, honestly-measured study rather than assertion.